WEBVTT

01:31.232 --> 01:33.664
[Episode 11]

01:34.458 --> 01:35.818
Mr. Shen.

01:35.818 --> 01:37.779
Meng is locked up in prison.

01:38.618 --> 01:40.258
I'm afraid they'll torture her.

01:41.139 --> 01:44.019
Please help me.

01:44.019 --> 01:45.378
Let me see her.

01:45.378 --> 01:48.258
His Majesty has decreed
that no one is allowed to visit.

01:51.219 --> 01:53.338
Meng, you poor thing.

01:55.579 --> 01:59.659
You served the court
but ended up being imprisoned.

01:59.659 --> 02:02.338
You go hungry and cold,

02:02.338 --> 02:03.579
and you'll be tortured.

02:05.299 --> 02:07.019
And no one is helping you.

02:07.938 --> 02:08.938
- Enough.
- What should I do?

02:09.819 --> 02:10.819
Enough.

02:12.019 --> 02:13.139
Stop crying.

02:13.139 --> 02:14.139
I'll make arrangements.

02:14.778 --> 02:15.778
Really?

02:18.938 --> 02:20.178
Thank you, Mr. Shen.

02:20.178 --> 02:22.178
Don't go falling in love with me

02:22.178 --> 02:23.259
over this.

02:25.019 --> 02:26.498
You're overthinking it.

02:26.498 --> 02:27.859
You're not up to my standards.

02:27.859 --> 02:30.498
The most dashing and talented man
in the capital

02:30.498 --> 02:31.898
is not good enough for you?

02:31.898 --> 02:33.338
Thank you anyway.

02:33.338 --> 02:35.658
No, don't thank me.

02:35.658 --> 02:37.539
I'm doing this for Zhi Li's sake.

02:37.539 --> 02:38.539
I'm here.

02:42.218 --> 02:44.458
Everything's packed. Let's go.

02:45.898 --> 02:47.859
Miss Meng will need all these.

02:47.859 --> 02:49.979
I'm afraid the prison is too damp for her.

02:49.979 --> 02:52.099
You're right, I left in a hurry

02:52.099 --> 02:53.819
and forgot to prepare these.

02:54.658 --> 02:57.019
I'm glad you care about Meng as much as I do.

02:57.019 --> 02:58.019
Thank you.

02:59.778 --> 03:02.618
Alright, no time to waste.

03:02.618 --> 03:04.178
You two, visit Miss Meng.

03:04.178 --> 03:05.379
I'll visit His Majesty.

03:07.778 --> 03:08.778
- Let's go.
- Alright.

03:18.898 --> 03:20.618
Excellent skills, Your Majesty.

03:20.618 --> 03:21.618
Come on.

03:22.419 --> 03:23.419
Your Majesty.

03:23.419 --> 03:25.979
I'd rather not spar with you
when you're in this mood.

03:26.699 --> 03:27.699
Your Majesty.

03:37.539 --> 03:38.539
Your Majesty.

03:38.539 --> 03:41.419
You can't take your anger out on us
over Meng Ting Hui.

03:45.338 --> 03:46.338
Miss Meng.

03:46.338 --> 03:48.299
This is your escape weapon.

03:49.658 --> 03:51.859
This drug knocks out the jailers.

03:51.859 --> 03:53.738
I'll lead you out of the prison.

03:55.299 --> 03:57.379
Great minds think alike.

03:57.379 --> 03:58.498
That's exactly my plan.

03:58.498 --> 04:00.218
Meng, don't put up with this.

04:00.218 --> 04:01.498
Just quit your job.

04:01.498 --> 04:03.299
Anyway, I haven't spent too much

04:03.299 --> 04:05.299
on the renovation of the Bofeng House branch.

04:05.299 --> 04:06.738
Let's sublease it

04:06.738 --> 04:08.539
and go back to our cozy lives in Shazhou.

04:10.218 --> 04:12.218
My brother arranged for us to visit,

04:12.218 --> 04:14.139
and you're scheming to break out
right in front of me.

04:14.139 --> 04:15.179
Is that appropriate?

04:16.458 --> 04:19.059
Given Mr. Shen's friendship with His Majesty,

04:19.059 --> 04:20.538
he won't be implicated.

04:20.538 --> 04:21.579
This is nonsense.

04:21.579 --> 04:22.619
If I escape,

04:22.619 --> 04:24.379
I'll become guilty for sure.

04:25.218 --> 04:28.259
Put away the knockout drugs and blades.

04:29.139 --> 04:31.098
But His Majesty went too far.

04:31.098 --> 04:33.939
You achieved Triple First
and became the Director of Censorate.

04:33.939 --> 04:35.499
He dismissed you just like that?

04:35.499 --> 04:37.019
And he locked you up.

04:37.019 --> 04:39.499
What happened to his word

04:39.499 --> 04:40.538
being as good as gold?

04:40.538 --> 04:41.939
It all depends on his mood.

04:41.939 --> 04:43.379
If I had been there,

04:43.379 --> 04:45.019
I would have scolded him

04:45.019 --> 04:47.059
and torn him to shreds with my words.

04:47.059 --> 04:50.019
Thank goodness you weren't there.

04:50.898 --> 04:53.538
Otherwise, you'd be locked up with her.

04:53.538 --> 04:54.939
We're here

04:54.939 --> 04:57.619
to advise you to apologize to His Majesty.

04:57.619 --> 04:58.939
Apologize to him?

04:58.939 --> 05:00.579
No way.

05:00.579 --> 05:02.778
She has no intention of repenting.

05:04.059 --> 05:05.739
I knew she might go to the extreme

05:05.739 --> 05:06.778
with cruel methods,

05:07.418 --> 05:10.179
but I never imagined she would act on her own

05:10.179 --> 05:11.778
without even informing me.

05:11.778 --> 05:12.778
That's right.

05:12.778 --> 05:15.298
A mere demotion
is already a sign of your mercy.

05:15.298 --> 05:17.418
I think she needs at least thirty lashes

05:17.418 --> 05:18.898
to learn this lesson.

05:19.619 --> 05:22.059
Zhi Li asked you to come and mediate,

05:22.059 --> 05:23.379
not to stir up trouble.

05:23.379 --> 05:26.338
Miss Meng acted on impulse.
She didn't mean to offend you.

05:27.019 --> 05:28.458
She didn't mean to?

05:28.458 --> 05:30.458
So I made things difficult for her?

05:30.458 --> 05:32.338
All the officials opposed my will.

05:33.338 --> 05:35.458
I overrode all objections to appoint her.

05:35.458 --> 05:37.218
But she didn't cherish it at all.

05:38.298 --> 05:41.019
I entered officialdom to purge evil

05:41.019 --> 05:42.019
and protect the people.

05:43.499 --> 05:44.778
When those in power

05:44.778 --> 05:46.338
care only for their own rise,

05:46.338 --> 05:48.059
their path is paved with bones.

05:48.059 --> 05:50.819
When the safety of the people is at stake,

05:50.819 --> 05:52.418
how can I stand by and watch?

05:52.418 --> 05:56.019
I saw how the Huxiao Gang
colluded with the authorities.

05:56.019 --> 05:59.658
If I don't wipe them out,
how can I intimidate those in power?

05:59.658 --> 06:02.858
If His Majesty
wanted someone conventional and obedient,

06:02.858 --> 06:05.458
why did he appoint me
as Director of Censorate?

06:05.458 --> 06:07.939
Exactly, Meng is right.

06:08.898 --> 06:10.699
The law may be my guiding principle,

06:10.699 --> 06:12.858
but this time, I'm siding with you.

06:13.499 --> 06:16.098
I hope you will be reinstated.

06:16.098 --> 06:18.978
And based on my understanding of His Majesty,

06:18.978 --> 06:20.819
he doesn't really want to dismiss you.

06:21.619 --> 06:24.858
Miss Meng, has His Majesty issued an edict?

06:26.179 --> 06:27.179
Not yet.

06:31.658 --> 06:33.458
Back in the palace,

06:33.458 --> 06:35.898
she acted tough, then showed weakness,

06:35.898 --> 06:36.898
and opened up to me.

06:37.579 --> 06:39.819
She used every trick to get that position.

06:39.819 --> 06:41.978
That's why I gave her a chance
and appointed her myself.

06:43.139 --> 06:45.418
But she didn't know her place.

06:45.418 --> 06:46.619
That's right.

06:46.619 --> 06:48.619
She's taking advantage of your favor.

06:48.619 --> 06:49.939
You trusted her with this post,

06:49.939 --> 06:51.298
but she challenged you.

06:51.298 --> 06:52.538
She's so reckless

06:52.538 --> 06:53.538
and untamed.

06:53.538 --> 06:55.619
She's not cut out for the imperial court.

06:55.619 --> 06:57.218
You should send her back home

06:57.218 --> 06:58.658
and never employ her again.

06:58.658 --> 07:00.418
You think you're better than her?

07:02.619 --> 07:05.858
I'm more competent as the Envoy of Customs.

07:05.858 --> 07:08.179
Meng Ting Hui's appointment

07:08.179 --> 07:09.978
was my careful decision.

07:09.978 --> 07:12.098
I know if she's suitable for this job.

07:12.098 --> 07:13.978
Then why did you lock her up?

07:17.458 --> 07:18.939
I see.

07:18.939 --> 07:21.458
Punishing Meng Ting Hui is just an act

07:21.458 --> 07:24.458
to appease Lord Xu
and the other court officials.

07:25.059 --> 07:28.658
You have really taken great pains
to protect Meng Ting Hui.

07:32.579 --> 07:34.538
Who told you I was protecting her?

07:46.978 --> 07:48.658
<i>Without an edict,</i>

07:48.658 --> 07:51.019
<i>you're still the Director of Censorate.</i>

07:51.019 --> 07:52.298
<i>We can turn things around.</i>

07:54.218 --> 07:56.059
<i>Aside from quelling public anger,</i>

07:56.898 --> 08:00.858
<i>what else is His Majesty after?</i>

08:11.579 --> 08:12.739
Phoenix.

08:14.338 --> 08:15.499
Where are you?

08:16.538 --> 08:17.538
My darling.

08:19.259 --> 08:20.739
Where did you fly off to?

08:21.898 --> 08:23.579
I haven't seen you all day.

08:24.499 --> 08:25.499
Master.

08:26.298 --> 08:27.298
Master.

08:29.139 --> 08:31.139
Have you seen Phoenix?

08:31.778 --> 08:32.778
No, I haven't.

08:33.459 --> 08:35.178
But there's a guest outside

08:35.178 --> 08:36.979
who brought you a fine pastry.

08:36.979 --> 08:39.538
He said you'd appreciate it once you saw it.

08:39.538 --> 08:41.739
Can't you see I'm busy?

08:41.739 --> 08:42.859
Put it down.

08:42.859 --> 08:44.019
- Get out.
- But--

08:44.019 --> 08:45.019
Go.

08:45.019 --> 08:46.418
I'll check the doorway.

08:47.178 --> 08:48.178
Look for it.

08:48.979 --> 08:49.979
Seriously.

08:54.058 --> 08:55.058
Phoenix.

08:56.778 --> 08:57.818
My darling.

09:00.459 --> 09:01.979
Where did you go?

09:21.259 --> 09:22.259
Phoenix...

09:23.219 --> 09:25.058
My darling!

09:25.739 --> 09:28.499
Who did this to you?

09:29.619 --> 09:31.499
My sweetheart.

09:31.499 --> 09:32.499
My sweet...

09:37.080 --> 09:42.810
[Kill]

09:57.739 --> 09:58.739
Lord Xu wants to see you.

09:58.739 --> 09:59.739
Let's go.

10:02.099 --> 10:04.099
Lord Xu must be busy with state affairs.

10:04.099 --> 10:05.818
Why would he ask to see a prisoner?

10:05.818 --> 10:07.259
No more questions.

10:07.259 --> 10:09.379
Naturally, Lord Xu has his reasons.

10:10.219 --> 10:11.739
If you dare torture me,

10:11.739 --> 10:14.339
His Majesty will surely find out.

10:14.339 --> 10:15.499
His Majesty?

10:15.499 --> 10:19.739
Do you really think His Majesty has time
to care about a prisoner like you?

10:19.739 --> 10:20.739
Move.

10:21.418 --> 10:23.938
Hands off me. I'll walk myself.

10:23.938 --> 10:27.339
Don't try anything funny,
or you'll regret it.

10:27.339 --> 10:28.339
Move.

11:22.298 --> 11:24.739
How I love the scent of death.

11:25.818 --> 11:27.418
Especially on a beauty.

11:28.418 --> 11:29.418
Who are you?

11:30.139 --> 11:31.619
Meng Ting Hui.

11:31.619 --> 11:34.778
I remember every word
of the message you sent me.

11:35.778 --> 11:38.219
Leader of the Huxiao Gang.

11:38.219 --> 11:41.178
I only regret not hacking Lv Er to pieces

11:41.178 --> 11:42.259
that very day.

11:42.938 --> 11:44.019
But it's alright.

11:45.619 --> 11:47.259
You're next.

11:47.859 --> 11:50.578
I'd like to see
how a dead person gets revenge.

11:52.739 --> 11:54.739
Lv Da, do it.

12:05.859 --> 12:07.099
Master.

12:07.099 --> 12:09.658
Lv Da, it's a trap. Retreat.

12:09.658 --> 12:10.979
- Alright.
- After them.

12:16.979 --> 12:18.139
Please don't be startled.

12:18.139 --> 12:20.459
His Majesty sent us to protect you in secret.

12:26.938 --> 12:28.339
By His Majesty's decree.

12:28.339 --> 12:30.099
We're here to bring Minister Wan Kai in
for interrogation.

12:34.459 --> 12:35.938
By His Majesty's decree.

12:35.938 --> 12:37.898
We're here to bring Minister Wan Kai in
for interrogation.

12:45.178 --> 12:46.178
Minister Wan.

12:46.898 --> 12:47.898
Minister Wan.

12:50.459 --> 12:51.739
Who did this to you?

13:10.979 --> 13:11.979
Minister Wan.

13:12.658 --> 13:13.658
Minister Wan.

13:18.259 --> 13:19.259
Master.

13:19.259 --> 13:20.339
Master, wait.

13:20.979 --> 13:21.979
No, no.

13:23.099 --> 13:24.099
I'm not making it.

13:24.818 --> 13:26.099
Just go.

13:26.099 --> 13:27.499
Nonsense. We go together.

13:36.339 --> 13:37.619
Towards Changle Street.

13:37.619 --> 13:38.619
Get them.

13:44.139 --> 13:47.058
Your Majesty, the leader of the Huxiao Gang
has vanished.

13:47.058 --> 13:48.619
The Shadow Guards

13:48.619 --> 13:50.459
only found bloodstains on Changle Street.

13:50.459 --> 13:51.818
He simply disappeared.

13:52.859 --> 13:54.058
Changle Street.

13:55.019 --> 13:56.459
Did Wan Kai say anything?

13:56.459 --> 13:57.979
I arrived at the Wan Mansion

13:57.979 --> 14:00.698
only to find Wan Kai dying
from a dagger wound.

14:01.499 --> 14:03.619
He left this before he died.

14:12.619 --> 14:14.778
If Wan Kai was nothing

14:14.778 --> 14:16.898
but a disposable pawn to the Huxiao Gang,

14:16.898 --> 14:20.298
the corruption in court
must be on a whole other level.

14:45.259 --> 14:48.058
Your Majesty came to pick up a commoner.

14:48.058 --> 14:49.459
I am flattered.

14:50.178 --> 14:51.418
You have suffered.

14:51.418 --> 14:52.538
For my aspiration,

14:53.418 --> 14:54.818
anything is worthwhile.

14:54.818 --> 14:56.099
Do you blame me?

14:56.099 --> 14:57.379
I wouldn't dare.

14:57.379 --> 15:01.818
But I would like to know the plan in advance
even as a commoner.

15:01.818 --> 15:03.459
Or I may not act convincingly.

15:04.099 --> 15:06.058
Stop calling yourself a commoner.

15:06.058 --> 15:08.339
You may have acted recklessly
with the Huxiao Gang,

15:08.339 --> 15:09.578
but your merits offset faults.

15:09.578 --> 15:12.058
I hereby restore you to your position

15:12.818 --> 15:14.298
as the Director of Censorate.

15:19.219 --> 15:21.499
Thank you, Your Majesty.

15:30.538 --> 15:33.418
The Huxiao Gang leader
indeed colluded with Wan Kai.

15:33.418 --> 15:36.058
But he fled to Changle Street and vanished.

15:36.058 --> 15:37.538
As for Wan Kai,

15:37.538 --> 15:38.938
he died at home

15:38.938 --> 15:40.578
just as I ordered his interrogation,

15:40.578 --> 15:41.979
only leaving behind a note.

15:41.979 --> 15:42.979
Your Majesty.

15:45.259 --> 15:46.859
Your Majesty used me as bait.

15:47.658 --> 15:48.739
I understand that.

15:49.619 --> 15:51.178
I hereby promise Your Majesty.

15:51.859 --> 15:54.178
As long as I am in the Censorate,

15:54.178 --> 15:57.219
I will see the Huxiao Gang case
through to the end.

15:57.219 --> 16:00.219
But today, I am tired.

16:01.739 --> 16:03.898
Please allow me to go back and rest.

16:05.339 --> 16:06.979
I'll have the imperial physicians

16:06.979 --> 16:09.219
treat the wound on your neck

16:09.219 --> 16:10.259
to not leave a scar.

16:11.658 --> 16:13.499
Let me take you back to the palace

16:13.499 --> 16:14.499
and then send you home.

16:15.259 --> 16:16.379
That's very kind of you.

16:18.058 --> 16:19.538
But don't trouble the imperial physicians.

16:20.298 --> 16:22.019
If it leaves a scar,

16:22.019 --> 16:26.058
it will constantly remind me
to stay true to my original aspiration

16:27.178 --> 16:28.259
and reflect on myself.

16:29.818 --> 16:33.178
Huang Bo, escort Miss Meng back.

16:33.178 --> 16:35.019
Ensure her safety.

16:35.019 --> 16:36.019
Yes, Your Majesty.

16:36.019 --> 16:37.938
Please allow me to go back alone.

16:39.979 --> 16:41.979
I take my leave.

16:50.058 --> 16:52.379
Will she keep hating me forever?

16:52.379 --> 16:53.499
Your Majesty.

16:53.499 --> 16:55.379
Miss Meng has a fiery temperament.

16:55.379 --> 16:56.459
Give her some time.

16:57.259 --> 16:59.578
I'm sure she will
understand your painstaking efforts.

17:00.419 --> 17:01.419
Painstaking efforts?

17:02.219 --> 17:04.939
She probably thinks
I am nothing but heartless.

17:20.699 --> 17:22.499
It's Miss Meng.

17:23.739 --> 17:25.578
- Miss Meng.
- Miss Meng is back.

17:25.578 --> 17:27.578
- Miss Meng.
- Miss Meng is back.

17:30.419 --> 17:32.659
- Miss Meng.
- Miss Meng is back.

17:33.298 --> 17:37.499
Miss Meng.

17:37.499 --> 17:38.499
Miss Meng.

17:38.499 --> 17:41.858
We've waited for three days,
and you're finally back.

17:41.858 --> 17:42.979
We're so happy.

17:43.659 --> 17:45.138
This is great.

17:45.939 --> 17:48.699
Miss Meng, your wound.

17:50.578 --> 17:51.578
Yeah.

17:53.419 --> 17:55.499
I scratched it myself.

17:56.659 --> 17:58.098
I'm glad you're safe.

17:58.818 --> 18:01.699
Has the Huxiao Gang been pestering you?

18:01.699 --> 18:03.058
No.

18:03.778 --> 18:05.499
Thanks to you, Miss Meng.

18:05.499 --> 18:09.219
The authorities took over the land
snatched by the Huxiao Gang.

18:09.219 --> 18:12.618
We have reburied our family's remains.

18:13.979 --> 18:16.378
Thank you for helping us find justice.

18:16.378 --> 18:18.219
That's right.

18:18.219 --> 18:21.019
You suffered such injustice for us.

18:21.818 --> 18:23.058
Thank you, Miss Meng.

18:23.058 --> 18:29.058
Thank you, Miss Meng.

18:29.058 --> 18:30.058
Get up.

18:30.058 --> 18:32.058
Cheng, get up.

18:33.778 --> 18:36.259
Get up. All of you.

18:36.259 --> 18:37.259
Get up.

18:39.098 --> 18:40.378
You don't need to do this.

18:40.378 --> 18:41.899
I merely did my job.

18:43.019 --> 18:44.378
I'm just glad you're fine.

18:44.378 --> 18:45.459
Miss Meng.

18:45.459 --> 18:48.138
Here's a small token of appreciation.
Please accept it.

18:48.138 --> 18:49.858
Please accept it.

18:49.858 --> 18:51.259
Take it back.

18:51.259 --> 18:52.499
It was simply my duty.

18:52.499 --> 18:53.818
- Take it back.
- Miss Meng.

18:53.818 --> 18:57.058
Those bullies drove our entire family out,

18:57.058 --> 18:59.578
turning us into homeless refugees.

18:59.578 --> 19:03.298
Thanks to you, we're finally able to go home.

19:03.298 --> 19:05.419
That's right.

19:06.979 --> 19:10.338
I picked these fruits from the mountain.

19:11.459 --> 19:13.338
Please accept them.

19:13.338 --> 19:14.338
Miss Meng.

19:15.098 --> 19:16.098
Miss Meng.

19:16.098 --> 19:17.818
I heard you are from Shazhou.

19:17.818 --> 19:19.618
I made this Shazhou dish.

19:19.618 --> 19:20.739
You are too thin.

19:20.739 --> 19:21.739
Please eat more.

19:22.818 --> 19:24.778
That's right, Miss Meng.

19:24.778 --> 19:26.138
Miss Meng.

19:26.138 --> 19:27.138
- Get up.
- Miss Meng.

19:27.138 --> 19:29.419
My daughter has been missing
for half a month.

19:30.098 --> 19:32.219
The authorities say they're too busy.

19:32.219 --> 19:34.298
Please help me.

19:34.298 --> 19:35.459
Miss Meng.

19:35.459 --> 19:37.058
Miss Meng.

19:37.058 --> 19:39.499
I've also suffered great injustice.

19:39.499 --> 19:41.858
Please seek justice for me.

19:42.578 --> 19:43.618
Rest assured.

19:44.259 --> 19:46.219
The Censorate

19:46.219 --> 19:48.899
will definitely seek justice
for every one of you.

19:48.899 --> 19:51.578
But I can't accept these things.

19:52.378 --> 19:55.138
You've worked so hard to save up something

19:55.138 --> 19:56.818
barely enough to sustain yourselves.

19:58.259 --> 20:00.979
But I appreciate your kindness.

20:01.899 --> 20:02.899
Thank you.

20:04.138 --> 20:06.298
Miss Meng, we should be thanking you.

20:06.939 --> 20:08.179
Now everyone knows

20:08.179 --> 20:11.179
that you and the Censorate
are working for the people.

20:12.019 --> 20:13.378
You are our pillar of support.

20:14.699 --> 20:17.499
From now on, it's not just you protecting us.

20:17.499 --> 20:19.578
We'll all protect you too.

20:19.578 --> 20:21.979
Please accept these gifts.

20:21.979 --> 20:23.578
Miss Meng, please accept them.

20:24.659 --> 20:25.858
I really can't.

20:26.459 --> 20:27.459
Thank you.

20:28.298 --> 20:29.699
I really can't.

20:29.699 --> 20:31.019
Take them.

20:31.019 --> 20:32.098
Please accept them.

20:39.840 --> 20:43.830
[Censorate]

20:55.320 --> 20:58.740
[Censorate]

21:03.098 --> 21:05.538
I have repeatedly ordered the arrest
of the Huxiao Gang,

21:06.298 --> 21:08.538
but it still hasn't been done.

21:09.259 --> 21:11.618
Are they exceptionally resourceful,

21:11.618 --> 21:13.778
or is someone secretly helping them?

21:15.459 --> 21:17.858
I understand Your Majesty's worry.

21:19.058 --> 21:21.019
The Ministry of Justice needs a leader

21:21.019 --> 21:22.499
after Wan Kai's death.

21:22.499 --> 21:25.538
I suggest we let the Vice Minister of War
take over for now

21:25.538 --> 21:27.659
and investigate the Huxiao Gang case.

21:27.659 --> 21:29.138
I have

21:29.138 --> 21:32.019
fully entrusted the case to the Censorate.

21:32.019 --> 21:36.058
As for the candidate for Minister of Justice,
I have someone in mind as well.

21:36.058 --> 21:37.058
Your Majesty.

21:37.899 --> 21:41.659
May I ask whom you intend to appoint?

21:41.659 --> 21:43.979
And may I ask

21:43.979 --> 21:47.338
why Wan Kai summoned Meng Ting Hui
on your order

21:47.338 --> 21:49.259
and then dropped dead in his mansion?

21:49.259 --> 21:52.378
Your Majesty, I swear on my life.

21:52.378 --> 21:55.219
I had no idea what Wan Kai had done.

21:55.219 --> 21:57.378
Nor was it by my order.

21:57.378 --> 22:00.499
I have political disagreements
with Meng Ting Hui,

22:00.499 --> 22:02.499
but I have no intention to harm her.

22:02.499 --> 22:04.259
Please see this clearly.

22:04.259 --> 22:06.618
You say it lightly, Lord Xu.

22:06.618 --> 22:09.818
Wan Kai made a huge mess,
and yet you knew nothing.

22:09.818 --> 22:12.019
If your dog bit someone,

22:12.019 --> 22:13.939
can you claim innocence?

22:13.939 --> 22:15.499
How dare you!

22:15.499 --> 22:19.259
I'm talking to His Majesty.
How dare you jest and interrupt?

22:19.979 --> 22:21.499
I'm just telling the truth.

22:21.499 --> 22:22.618
If you are innocent,

22:22.618 --> 22:24.699
why would you be afraid of my jokes?

22:24.699 --> 22:27.338
Shen Zhi Shu,
show the Left Chancellor some respect.

22:30.699 --> 22:34.259
It's just that
the Ministry of War was trading arms.

22:34.259 --> 22:36.338
The Ministry of Rites
was involved in exam fraud.

22:36.338 --> 22:38.419
Even the Minister of Justice
colluded with gangs

22:38.419 --> 22:40.058
against the people.

22:40.058 --> 22:42.138
You've overseen the six ministries for years.

22:43.219 --> 22:47.019
The claim of ignorance is probably not enough
to get you out of it.

22:54.739 --> 22:56.179
I have failed in my duty.

22:59.659 --> 23:03.578
I ask to resign from my official post

23:03.578 --> 23:04.939
and retire to my hometown.

23:09.499 --> 23:12.699
Your Majesty, the late emperor
assigned Lord Xu to this job.

23:12.699 --> 23:14.138
He's been aiding you

23:14.138 --> 23:15.138
for over ten years.

23:15.858 --> 23:17.578
Now, even in his seventies,

23:17.578 --> 23:20.019
he still rises at the Yin hour
to review memorials

23:20.019 --> 23:21.618
and comes to court at the Mao hour.

23:22.259 --> 23:24.659
I hope Your Majesty will punish him lightly

23:24.659 --> 23:25.818
for the sake of your ties.

23:26.659 --> 23:27.818
Your Majesty.

23:27.818 --> 23:29.699
The law bends to human sentiment.

23:29.699 --> 23:31.259
To punish Lord Xu severely

23:31.259 --> 23:33.858
may seem disheartening to the old ministers.

23:33.858 --> 23:35.979
A feigned retreat to gain ground. Brilliant.

23:35.979 --> 23:39.858
You are forcing His Majesty
to choose between law and human sentiment.

23:59.378 --> 24:00.378
Lord Xu,

24:00.378 --> 24:04.058
you are a meritorious official
of three reigns of our Ning Empire,

24:04.058 --> 24:05.818
and a pillar of the state

24:05.818 --> 24:06.979
with great service.

24:08.098 --> 24:10.538
How could I truly punish you severely?

24:10.538 --> 24:13.098
But you have advanced in years.

24:14.019 --> 24:16.659
I should personally attend to the affairs

24:16.659 --> 24:18.659
of the six ministries.

24:20.298 --> 24:24.138
I won't trouble you to labor on my behalf.

24:27.019 --> 24:28.338
Thank you, Your Majesty.

24:44.459 --> 24:45.578
Yes!

24:47.098 --> 24:49.058
The Bofeng House opens today.

24:49.058 --> 24:50.979
Please come in.

24:50.979 --> 24:52.739
Please come in.

24:53.699 --> 24:56.538
Please come in. Mind the steps.

24:56.538 --> 24:58.530
[Bofeng House]

25:00.019 --> 25:01.699
What a lousy restaurant.

25:01.699 --> 25:04.499
How dare they steal my business
on their very first day?

25:04.499 --> 25:05.699
My lady.

25:06.459 --> 25:07.459
My lady.

25:07.459 --> 25:08.659
I got information.

25:08.659 --> 25:13.259
The owner of Bofeng House is Yan Fu Zhi,
the sworn sister of Miss Meng.

25:13.259 --> 25:15.979
They've stayed at our inn before.

25:16.979 --> 25:18.899
So it's those two.

25:18.899 --> 25:20.939
I knew it was a collusion

25:20.939 --> 25:22.259
between officials and merchants.

25:23.419 --> 25:24.538
Shun.

25:24.538 --> 25:26.618
Keep an eye on them.

25:26.618 --> 25:29.019
I'll catch them slipping up sooner or later.

25:33.090 --> 25:35.610
[Chunman House]

25:38.858 --> 25:40.818
Ms. Yan, no need to see us further.

25:40.818 --> 25:43.979
Gentlemen,
this is our exclusive Shazhou candied fruit.

25:43.979 --> 25:46.058
Paired with apricot skin tea,
it cuts the grease.

25:46.058 --> 25:47.259
Please kindly accept it.

25:49.739 --> 25:50.979
How thoughtful.

25:50.979 --> 25:52.659
We will definitely come every day

25:52.659 --> 25:54.499
and try all the Shazhou delicacies.

25:54.499 --> 25:56.459
That would be wonderful.

25:56.459 --> 25:57.459
Farewell.

25:57.459 --> 25:58.459
Take care.

26:01.459 --> 26:03.378
Ms. Yan, wipe your drool.

26:03.378 --> 26:04.378
They've gone far.

26:04.378 --> 26:07.538
Mr. Shen, which lady did you bring today?

26:10.818 --> 26:11.858
Your...

26:15.699 --> 26:16.818
Ms. Yan.

26:16.818 --> 26:17.899
Wake up.

26:17.899 --> 26:19.338
This is a bit exaggerated.

26:19.338 --> 26:21.259
Don't make me give you mouth-to-mouth.

26:24.338 --> 26:25.338
In your dreams.

26:27.939 --> 26:30.179
I heard Bofeng House is opening today.

26:30.179 --> 26:31.419
We came to show support.

26:32.298 --> 26:34.778
No need for formalities. Just call me He Du.

26:34.778 --> 26:35.778
Where is she?

26:36.378 --> 26:37.499
Right upstairs.

26:37.499 --> 26:38.699
Mr. He, this way, please.

26:39.699 --> 26:40.739
Mind the steps.

26:40.739 --> 26:41.778
Ms. Yan.

26:41.778 --> 26:43.899
Why favor one customer over another?

26:45.818 --> 26:47.219
It feels like

26:47.219 --> 26:49.618
you've moved the desert
right into the capital.

26:49.618 --> 26:52.019
Every corner is scenic, a world of its own.

26:52.019 --> 26:53.419
Interesting.

26:53.419 --> 26:54.699
On Changle Street,

26:54.699 --> 26:56.979
how can we keep our guests
without something unique?

26:58.378 --> 27:00.578
The Wangyou Pavilion is reserved for Meng.

27:00.578 --> 27:03.939
All other private rooms are for guests
who spend over 100 taels per visit.

27:03.939 --> 27:05.699
With your capability, Mr. Shen,

27:05.699 --> 27:07.699
you'll soon have a room of your own.

27:14.338 --> 27:15.338
Meng.

27:24.298 --> 27:25.298
Your Majesty.

27:25.298 --> 27:26.298
Your Majesty.

27:27.138 --> 27:30.858
You really bring this pretty boy
everywhere you go.

27:30.858 --> 27:34.538
Your Majesty, Yin Qing
is my colleague from the Censorate,

27:34.538 --> 27:36.459
not some pretty boy.

27:36.459 --> 27:37.699
I am handling a case.

27:37.699 --> 27:39.939
Naturally, Yin Qing will follow me around.

27:41.179 --> 27:42.179
Miss Meng.

27:42.179 --> 27:44.899
His Majesty meant it as a compliment.

27:47.259 --> 27:48.259
Handling a case?

27:49.818 --> 27:51.338
You're handling a case here?

27:52.298 --> 27:55.378
The Huxiao Gang leader
was last seen on Changle Street.

27:55.378 --> 27:57.419
If I were to search openly,

27:57.419 --> 27:59.058
it may alert them.

27:59.058 --> 28:02.378
Bofeng House sits on Changle Street.
A perfect spot for watching.

28:02.378 --> 28:06.298
I've made this room my base of operations.

28:06.939 --> 28:07.939
Your Majesty.

28:12.659 --> 28:13.659
Nian.

28:13.659 --> 28:15.858
So you rushed out of the door

28:15.858 --> 28:17.659
to do odd jobs for Zhi Li.

28:17.659 --> 28:19.098
It's not odd jobs.

28:19.098 --> 28:21.298
Nian is helping with official business.

28:25.298 --> 28:26.778
Your Majesty.

28:26.778 --> 28:30.058
Miss Meng has been worried
about the investigation.

28:30.058 --> 28:32.659
I drew this based on her description.

28:32.659 --> 28:34.818
Although we only
have a pair of eyes as a clue,

28:34.818 --> 28:36.778
we will follow Miss Meng's plan

28:36.778 --> 28:39.019
and thoroughly search Changle Street.

28:39.019 --> 28:40.578
I know all the noble families.

28:40.578 --> 28:44.419
So I'll watch
the high-end tea houses and herbal shops.

28:44.419 --> 28:46.699
Yin Qing is good with ladies.

28:46.699 --> 28:49.818
So he'll watch all the cosmetics shops,

28:49.818 --> 28:51.699
music houses, and brothels.

28:51.699 --> 28:53.298
As for Miss Meng.

28:53.298 --> 28:56.899
She told me she grew up
dealing with all sorts of people.

28:56.899 --> 29:00.338
So she'll watch all the gambling dens

29:00.338 --> 29:02.098
and private banks.

29:02.098 --> 29:03.098
Your Majesty.

29:04.179 --> 29:08.419
Do we need to keep you updated
and wait for your approval

29:08.419 --> 29:09.419
to proceed?

29:11.219 --> 29:12.219
Not really.

29:12.219 --> 29:14.899
Then what brings you here, Your Majesty?

29:17.858 --> 29:19.538
Regarding Wan Kai's death,

29:19.538 --> 29:21.259
Xu Ting looked honest

29:21.259 --> 29:23.019
and sounded genuinely indignant.

29:24.659 --> 29:26.298
The message Wan Kai left behind

29:26.298 --> 29:27.459
remains unclear.

29:28.499 --> 29:31.618
I need you
to thoroughly investigate the Huxiao Gang,

29:32.259 --> 29:33.939
and find the person behind them.

29:39.858 --> 29:42.499
I will look into this
with the utmost diligence.

29:48.699 --> 29:51.659
This is a secret remedy for removing scars.

29:51.659 --> 29:53.138
His Majesty got it for you.

29:56.699 --> 29:58.298
Thank you, Your Majesty.

29:59.298 --> 30:01.778
But I have
applied Yin Qing's scar removal cream.

30:02.618 --> 30:04.019
My wound is already healing.

30:04.659 --> 30:05.659
Your Majesty.

30:05.659 --> 30:07.338
Miss Meng doesn't need it anymore.

30:07.338 --> 30:08.378
Your Majesty.

30:08.378 --> 30:09.979
Miss Meng means to say

30:09.979 --> 30:13.219
that the two creams
might cancel each other out

30:13.219 --> 30:14.659
if mixed.

30:14.659 --> 30:18.338
Are you saying
your medicine is more effective than mine?

30:23.179 --> 30:24.219
No, no.

30:26.419 --> 30:27.699
Thank you, Your Majesty.

30:29.538 --> 30:30.618
No more business talk.

30:30.618 --> 30:32.019
Actually, Mr. He came here

30:32.019 --> 30:34.259
just to enjoy some authentic lamb noodles.

30:37.138 --> 30:38.138
Meng.

30:38.138 --> 30:41.058
You've been learning to make lamb noodles.

30:41.058 --> 30:42.659
So it was for Mr. He.

30:42.659 --> 30:46.019
Mr. He, look forward
to the authentic lamb noodles.

30:46.019 --> 30:47.058
I...

30:47.058 --> 30:48.058
- I did not.
- Let's go.

30:50.499 --> 30:52.659
I have an appointment to study painting
with Master.

30:52.659 --> 30:55.219
Then I'll handle the tasks
Miss Meng assigned.

30:55.219 --> 30:56.618
I'll let you enjoy your drink.

30:58.219 --> 31:01.298
Only Lord Gu
can make you abandon Nian and me.

31:01.298 --> 31:03.138
Zhi Li, let me see you out.

31:04.019 --> 31:06.778
Only Zhi Li can make you abandon me.

31:06.778 --> 31:08.499
Your Majesty, Mr. Shen.

31:08.499 --> 31:12.019
I just remembered,
Miss Meng also has tasks for me.

31:12.019 --> 31:13.098
I take my leave.

31:17.378 --> 31:18.739
Your Majesty's cream works better.

31:21.378 --> 31:22.818
Why did everybody leave?

31:37.899 --> 31:38.939
Meng.

31:38.939 --> 31:41.578
Mr. He came to Bofeng House in person

31:41.578 --> 31:42.818
and asked for lamb noodles.

31:43.858 --> 31:45.979
You think he regrets punishing you

31:45.979 --> 31:48.058
and wants to ease things with you?

31:48.659 --> 31:52.419
His Majesty's mind is hard to fathom.
We must not speculate recklessly.

31:53.058 --> 31:54.778
Let alone flatter ourselves.

31:54.778 --> 31:57.098
You're right. He's the emperor, after all.

31:57.098 --> 31:59.179
You must not talk back to him again.

31:59.179 --> 32:01.618
Otherwise, he could have us executed.

32:01.618 --> 32:03.259
I didn't talk back to him.

32:03.259 --> 32:04.778
Sure, if you say so.

32:04.778 --> 32:05.778
Meng, listen.

32:05.778 --> 32:08.019
Tell him you made this bowl of lamb noodles.

32:11.459 --> 32:14.699
Fu Zhi, deceiving His Majesty
is a capital offense.

32:15.659 --> 32:16.979
What should we do?

32:22.899 --> 32:23.899
Yan Fu Zhi.

32:23.899 --> 32:25.179
Listen to me.

32:25.179 --> 32:26.979
You sprinkled these scallions.

32:26.979 --> 32:29.378
So basically,
you made this bowl of lamb noodles.

32:29.378 --> 32:31.298
I just helped you a little.

32:31.298 --> 32:32.659
We're not deceiving anyone.

32:44.858 --> 32:45.858
Meng!

32:49.058 --> 32:50.058
Meng.

32:51.858 --> 32:53.098
Meng, have you lost it?

32:59.659 --> 33:02.098
Looks like I'm the one
who made the noodles now.

33:19.770 --> 33:24.300
[Bofeng House]

33:30.618 --> 33:33.578
I still remember that bowl of lamb noodles
you bought me.

33:34.578 --> 33:36.459
So you're here to collect a debt.

33:38.219 --> 33:39.219
What do you think?

33:39.219 --> 33:41.939
Are you happy with all these dishes?

33:41.939 --> 33:44.138
Isn't this a bit too extravagant?

33:44.138 --> 33:46.138
Don't worry, you're not spending a penny.

33:46.138 --> 33:47.939
It's on Ms. Yan.

33:47.939 --> 33:50.659
So you're putting it on Miss Yan's tab,

33:50.659 --> 33:52.699
while claiming to buy me dinner.

33:52.699 --> 33:54.459
You're mistaken.

33:54.459 --> 33:56.739
I've prepared a big surprise for you.

33:57.578 --> 33:58.979
Miss Situ has arrived.

33:59.939 --> 34:00.939
There she is.

34:03.138 --> 34:05.019
Mr. Shen, Mr. He.

34:06.618 --> 34:08.698
Thank you for inviting me. Nice to meet you.

34:08.698 --> 34:10.618
Miss Situ, what a pleasure.

34:10.618 --> 34:13.098
So this is the surprise you prepared.

34:17.738 --> 34:18.738
Mr. He.

34:18.738 --> 34:20.738
Here comes the lamb noodles made by Meng.

34:21.658 --> 34:22.658
Come on.

34:28.459 --> 34:29.459
Enjoy.

34:30.819 --> 34:33.538
Mr. He, please enjoy.

34:33.538 --> 34:34.698
Everyone is here.

34:34.698 --> 34:35.859
Miss Meng, Ms. Yan,

34:35.859 --> 34:37.178
let me introduce you.

34:37.178 --> 34:38.299
This is the legendary--

34:38.299 --> 34:39.698
Situ Xue.

34:39.698 --> 34:41.859
Miss Meng, you know Miss Situ too?

34:41.859 --> 34:44.738
Mr. He has mentioned you. I truly admire you.

34:44.738 --> 34:45.979
You flatter me, Miss Meng.

34:45.979 --> 34:47.379
I've heard so much about you.

34:47.379 --> 34:49.859
It's such a great honor to meet you today.

34:49.859 --> 34:53.299
My cousin specially invited Miss Situ here

34:53.299 --> 34:54.939
to celebrate the grand opening.

34:56.138 --> 34:57.339
Thank you, Mr. He.

35:01.459 --> 35:04.258
You must be Ms. Yan of the Bofeng House.

35:04.979 --> 35:06.899
Yes, that's me.

35:06.899 --> 35:10.178
I've arranged for some musicians

35:10.178 --> 35:11.738
to celebrate the grand opening.

35:11.738 --> 35:14.738
I brought you a golden qilin
as a welcoming gift.

35:14.738 --> 35:16.899
I wish you a thriving business.

35:16.899 --> 35:18.138
Your presence brings light

35:18.138 --> 35:19.859
to our humble establishment.

35:19.859 --> 35:21.459
There's no need for gifts.

35:21.459 --> 35:23.218
Zhao Cai, put it away.

35:25.138 --> 35:26.618
Don't just stand there.

35:26.618 --> 35:28.299
Try our signature dishes.

35:30.459 --> 35:31.979
I didn't expect to have

35:31.979 --> 35:32.979
the real...

35:32.979 --> 35:34.339
Miss Situ, please try some.

35:34.339 --> 35:35.859
You don't socialize much.

35:35.859 --> 35:37.738
Thanks to my cousin's hospitality...

35:40.658 --> 35:41.658
It's nothing.

35:41.658 --> 35:43.138
Everyone, please enjoy.

35:59.779 --> 36:01.779
Don't you like spicy food?

36:01.779 --> 36:03.299
What's this today?

36:03.299 --> 36:05.939
Mr. He, warm soup is good for the stomach.

36:05.939 --> 36:07.459
Is the lamb soup good?

36:09.138 --> 36:10.138
Yes.

36:10.979 --> 36:12.299
It's amazing.

36:12.299 --> 36:14.618
It's just like the one in Shazhou.

36:14.618 --> 36:16.779
Spicy and fierce.

36:19.339 --> 36:20.618
Have some more then.

36:21.258 --> 36:24.299
You could eat two bowls of noodles
back in Shazhou.

36:24.299 --> 36:26.538
Have some buckthorn honey juice
to soothe the spice.

36:29.379 --> 36:31.738
Miss Meng, how can I repay

36:32.859 --> 36:34.618
your warm hospitality?

36:35.899 --> 36:37.698
You jest, Mr. He.

36:37.698 --> 36:41.819
You're thoughtful enough to invite Miss Situ.

36:41.819 --> 36:43.538
What does my bowl of noodles amount to?

36:43.538 --> 36:46.258
I've only met Miss Situ a few times.

36:46.258 --> 36:49.178
I was quite surprised that she graced us

36:49.178 --> 36:50.538
with her presence today.

36:52.218 --> 36:55.258
Ms. Yan and I
both do business on Changle Street.

36:55.258 --> 36:57.178
And I've heard so much about Miss Meng,

36:57.178 --> 36:58.538
wishing to get to know her.

36:59.899 --> 37:01.178
That's why I came.

37:02.779 --> 37:05.538
Let me take this opportunity
to propose a toast.

37:11.819 --> 37:15.419
<i>How can the ruler of an empire
be so vindictive?</i>

37:15.419 --> 37:19.658
<i>You brought Situ Xue
to mock my clumsy imitation in Shazhou.</i>

37:19.658 --> 37:21.578
<i>I can't defend myself at all.</i>

37:22.859 --> 37:24.339
<i>You've really done me in.</i>

37:24.339 --> 37:28.098
<i>It seems they are not
simply ruler and minister.</i>

37:29.819 --> 37:31.658
<i>I thought you could be reliable for once.</i>

37:31.658 --> 37:33.019
<i>You can't do anything right.</i>

37:34.019 --> 37:36.218
Fine wine, delicious food,
and beauties by my side.

37:36.218 --> 37:37.738
Let's drink to our hearts' content.

37:40.019 --> 37:42.178
It's a rare opportunity for us to gather.

37:42.178 --> 37:44.859
But I have duties to attend to. Excuse me.

37:44.859 --> 37:47.698
Meng, are you alright? I'll go with you.

37:47.698 --> 37:51.098
No need. Miss Situ is a rare guest.

37:51.098 --> 37:53.459
Stay and have a few more drinks with her.

37:57.339 --> 37:59.138
Please carry on.

37:59.138 --> 38:02.098
I also have work to do. Please enjoy.

38:04.738 --> 38:05.738
Cousin.

38:08.779 --> 38:10.779
Ms. Yan, Mr. Shen.

38:10.779 --> 38:13.178
I also have work to do at my music house.

38:13.178 --> 38:14.178
I take my leave.

38:21.339 --> 38:23.098
Such good Shaosanbai wine.

38:23.098 --> 38:24.738
Why did everyone leave?

38:24.738 --> 38:26.538
Ms. Yan, let's drink.

38:31.178 --> 38:32.178
Wait.

38:32.979 --> 38:36.899
You haven't served the tribute wine, right?

38:38.299 --> 38:41.019
Mr. Shen, I'll get it for you right away.

38:41.939 --> 38:43.939
Yeah, drink yourself to death.

38:46.019 --> 38:48.738
Mr. Shen, here's the tribute wine.

38:50.218 --> 38:52.698
Have more. But don't throw up.

38:53.819 --> 38:54.819
Cheers.

39:03.299 --> 39:04.299
Take care, sir.

39:04.299 --> 39:06.750
[Xingrong Gambling House]

39:11.258 --> 39:12.258
This way.

39:15.979 --> 39:17.419
<i>Most gangs run gambling dens.</i>

39:17.419 --> 39:19.258
<i>Most gambling dens are full of cheats.</i>

39:19.258 --> 39:21.698
<i>The Huxiao Gang can't be an exception.</i>

39:27.019 --> 39:28.019
Stop.

39:29.738 --> 39:31.299
No unauthorized entry.

39:31.299 --> 39:32.939
Why can't I go upstairs?

39:34.538 --> 39:35.618
Please forgive us.

39:36.979 --> 39:38.419
This is our rule.

39:39.658 --> 39:42.459
You must win 10,000 taels to go upstairs.

39:42.459 --> 39:44.299
- You are--
- I'm the dealer, Gui.

39:45.098 --> 39:46.098
I don't recall seeing you before.

39:46.098 --> 39:48.178
Is this your first time here?

39:48.939 --> 39:51.618
Newcomers get ten taels of betting credit
as a welcome gift.

39:51.618 --> 39:53.658
Your boss knows how to run a business.

39:54.419 --> 39:56.979
Quite a figure in the underworld, I suppose?

39:56.979 --> 39:57.979
You're very sharp.

39:57.979 --> 39:59.098
Our boss is surnamed Hao.

39:59.098 --> 40:00.859
All the fellows honor him as Mr. Hao.

40:00.859 --> 40:01.859
Mr. Hao.

40:02.658 --> 40:05.299
Alright, I'll try my luck today.

40:06.178 --> 40:07.178
This way.

40:08.160 --> 40:11.030
[Small, Big]

40:12.138 --> 40:14.658
Miss, just a second.
I'll invite someone to join you.

40:16.979 --> 40:18.779
Third Master, we have a new guest.

40:18.779 --> 40:20.459
Would you like to join in?

40:20.459 --> 40:22.138
Why would I gamble with a woman?

40:22.138 --> 40:23.138
Wait.

40:25.218 --> 40:27.658
Mr. Wang, join us for a game.

40:27.658 --> 40:29.859
- A lady? Not interested.
- Wait.

40:29.859 --> 40:30.899
I'll join you.

40:36.779 --> 40:38.779
Sir, please have a seat.

40:43.459 --> 40:45.779
Mr. He, you're in quite the mood today.

40:45.779 --> 40:47.538
Since no one else would play with you,

40:48.779 --> 40:51.218
I figured I'd step in, reluctantly.

40:53.019 --> 40:54.138
In that case,

40:56.058 --> 40:57.058
let's get started.
